<span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/38px-Ico_stats.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Ico stats.png\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> <details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>UID</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">WPN_GOB_PainPriest_Dagger</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:WPN_GOB_PainPriest_Dagger\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:WPN_GOB_PainPriest_Dagger\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span> <details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>UUID</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">11aa209f-6e42-40bd-a12c-aa33445c21ea</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:11aa209f-6e42-40bd-a12c-aa33445c21ea\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:11aa209f-6e42-40bd-a12c-aa33445c21ea\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span> <details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>Stats</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">GOB_PainPriest_Dagger</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:GOB_PainPriest_Dagger+type:stat\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:GOB_PainPriest_Dagger+type:stat\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span></dd></dl>\n</div> \n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Special\"> Special </span></h3>\n<p><b>The holder of this item gains:</b>\n\n</p>\n<dl>\n<dt><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Blood_Sacrifice\" title=\"Blood Sacrifice\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/55/Blood_Sacrifice_Icon.webp/40px-Blood_Sacrifice_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/55/Blood_Sacrifice_Icon.webp/60px-Blood_Sacrifice_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/5/55/Blood_Sacrifice_Icon.webp/80px-Blood_Sacrifice_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Blood Sacrifice\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/55/Blood_Sacrifice_Icon.webp/40px-Blood_Sacrifice_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/5/55/Blood_Sacrifice_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Blood_Sacrifice\" title=\"Blood Sacrifice\">Blood Sacrifice</a> (<span aria-label=\"Bonus Action\"><span style=\"margin: -3px\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon nowrap\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c9/Bonus_Action_Icon.png/23px-Bonus_Action_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/c/c9/Bonus_Action_Icon.png/35px-Bonus_Action_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/c/c9/Bonus_Action_Icon.png/46px-Bonus_Action_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Bonus Action\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c9/Bonus_Action_Icon.png/23px-Bonus_Action_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/c/c9/Bonus_Action_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span>)</dt>\n<dd>Pain is a path to power. Take <span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-slashing\">1d4</span>⁠<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Slashing\" title=\"Slashing\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f0/Slashing_Damage_Icon.png/25px-Slashing_Damage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/f0/Slashing_Damage_Icon.png/38px-Slashing_Damage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/f/f0/Slashing_Damage_Icon.png/50px-Slashing_Damage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Slashing\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f0/Slashing_Damage_Icon.png/25px-Slashing_Damage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/f/f0/Slashing_Damage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Slashing\" title=\"Slashing\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-slashing\">Slashing</span></a> damage to receive +1d4 bonus to <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/ba/Attack_Roll_Icon.png/25px-Attack_Roll_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/b/ba/Attack_Roll_Icon.png/38px-Attack_Roll_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/b/ba/Attack_Roll_Icon.png/50px-Attack_Roll_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Attack roll\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/ba/Attack_Roll_Icon.png/25px-Attack_Roll_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/b/ba/Attack_Roll_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Attack_roll\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Attack roll\">Attack rolls</a> and <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png/25px-Saving_Throw_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Saving throw\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png/25px-Saving_Throw_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Saving_throw\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Saving throw\">Saving throws</a>. </dd>\n</dl>\n<dl><dt><a href=\"/wiki/The_Pain_Maiden%27s_Blessing\" title=\"The Pain Maiden's Blessing\">The Pain Maiden's Blessing</a></dt><dd>After a successful attack with this dagger, the wielder receives a +1d4 bonus to <a href=\"/wiki/Attack_Roll\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Attack Roll\">Attack Rolls</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/Saving_Throw\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Saving Throw\">Saving Throws</a> until the end of their next turn.<sup><i>[<a href=\"/wiki/The_Pain_Maiden%27s_Blessing#Bugs\" title=\"The Pain Maiden's Blessing\">See: Bugs</a>]</i></sup></dd></dl>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Weapon_actions\"> Weapon actions </span></h3>\n<p><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/2d/Proficiency_Icon.png/22px-Proficiency_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/2/2d/Proficiency_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Proficiency Icon.png\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/2d/Proficiency_Icon.png/22px-Proficiency_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"22\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/2/2d/Proficiency_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> <i>If you have <a href=\"/wiki/Proficiency\" title=\"Proficiency\">proficiency</a>, equip in <strong>main hand</strong> to gain:</i>\n</p>\n<dl>\n<dt><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Piercing_Strike\" title=\"Piercing Strike\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c4/Piercing_Strike_Icon.webp/40px-Piercing_Strike_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/c/c4/Piercing_Strike_Icon.webp/60px-Piercing_Strike_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/c/c4/Piercing_Strike_Icon.webp/80px-Piercing_Strike_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Piercing Strike\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c4/Piercing_Strike_Icon.webp/40px-Piercing_Strike_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/c/c4/Piercing_Strike_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Piercing_Strike\" title=\"Piercing Strike\">Piercing Strike</a> (<span aria-label=\"Action\"><span style=\"margin: -3px\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon nowrap\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/23px-Action_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/35px-Action_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/46px-Action_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Action\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/23px-Action_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/f/f2/Action_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span>)</dt>\n<dd>Stab an enemy and possibly inflict <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Gaping_Wounds_(Condition)\" title=\"Gaping Wounds (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/a/ab/Open_Wound_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Open_Wound_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/a/ab/Open_Wound_Condition_Icon.webp/38px-Open_Wound_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/a/ab/Open_Wound_Condition_Icon.webp/50px-Open_Wound_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Gaping Wounds\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/a/ab/Open_Wound_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Open_Wound_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/a/ab/Open_Wound_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Gaping_Wounds_(Condition)\" title=\"Gaping Wounds (Condition)\">Gaping Wounds</a>. (<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png/25px-Recharge_Icons.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png/38px-Recharge_Icons.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Recharge: Short rest\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png/25px-Recharge_Icons.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Recharge: <a href=\"/wiki/Short_rest\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Short rest\">Short rest</a>.)</dd>\n</dl></div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Where_to_find\"> Where to find </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Shattered_Sanctum\" title=\"Shattered Sanctum\">Shattered Sanctum</a> <span class=\"bg3wiki-coordinates\">X:&nbsp;338&nbsp;Y:&nbsp;-26</span>: Near <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Abdirak\" title=\"Abdirak\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/1/10/Portrait_Abdirak.png/25px-Portrait_Abdirak.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/1/10/Portrait_Abdirak.png/38px-Portrait_Abdirak.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/1/10/Portrait_Abdirak.png/50px-Portrait_Abdirak.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Abdirak\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/1/10/Portrait_Abdirak.png/25px-Portrait_Abdirak.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/1/10/Portrait_Abdirak.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Abdirak\" title=\"Abdirak\">Abdirak</a> or carried by him</li></ul>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\"> Notes </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>Depending on when the party members arrive, Abdirak may be carrying it, or it may be on the table or the floor near him.</li>\n<li>Both effects of this weapon grant the equivalent of a 1-turn duration <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Bless\" title=\"Bless\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c4/Bless_Icon.webp/25px-Bless_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/c/c4/Bless_Icon.webp/38px-Bless_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/c/c4/Bless_Icon.webp/50px-Bless_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Bless\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c4/Bless_Icon.webp/25px-Bless_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/c/c4/Bless_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Bless\" title=\"Bless\">Bless</a> to the wielder. These do not stack with other <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Bless\" title=\"Bless\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c4/Bless_Icon.webp/25px-Bless_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/c/c4/Bless_Icon.webp/38px-Bless_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/c/c4/Bless_Icon.webp/50px-Bless_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Bless\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c4/Bless_Icon.webp/25px-Bless_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/c/c4/Bless_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Bless\" title=\"Bless\">Bless</a> effects, or with each other.</li>\n<li>In comparison to <span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-uncommon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Ritual_Axe\" title=\"Ritual Axe\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/cf/Handaxe_PlusOne_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-Handaxe_PlusOne_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/c/cf/Handaxe_PlusOne_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Handaxe_PlusOne_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/c/cf/Handaxe_PlusOne_Unfaded_Icon.png/40px-Handaxe_PlusOne_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/cf/Handaxe_PlusOne_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-Handaxe_PlusOne_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/c/cf/Handaxe_PlusOne_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Ritual_Axe\" title=\"Ritual Axe\">Ritual Axe</a>, the self-damage caused by the dagger is not magical so it can be reduced even by non-magical damage reduction effects like <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Heavy_Armour_Master\" title=\"Heavy Armour Master\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/8d/Heavy_Armour_Master_Icon.webp/25px-Heavy_Armour_Master_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/8d/Heavy_Armour_Master_Icon.webp/38px-Heavy_Armour_Master_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/8/8d/Heavy_Armour_Master_Icon.webp/50px-Heavy_Armour_Master_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Heavy Armour Master\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/8d/Heavy_Armour_Master_Icon.webp/25px-Heavy_Armour_Master_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/8/8d/Heavy_Armour_Master_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Heavy_Armour_Master\" title=\"Heavy Armour Master\">Heavy Armour Master</a>.</li></ul>\n\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Bugs\"> Bugs </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Blood_Sacrifice\" title=\"Blood Sacrifice\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/55/Blood_Sacrifice_Icon.webp/20px-Blood_Sacrifice_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/55/Blood_Sacrifice_Icon.webp/30px-Blood_Sacrifice_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/5/55/Blood_Sacrifice_Icon.webp/40px-Blood_Sacrifice_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Blood Sacrifice\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/55/Blood_Sacrifice_Icon.webp/20px-Blood_Sacrifice_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/5/55/Blood_Sacrifice_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Blood_Sacrifice\" title=\"Blood Sacrifice\">Blood Sacrifice</a> generates a <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Blood_(surface)\" title=\"Blood (surface)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/34/Blood_surface_Icon.webp/25px-Blood_surface_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/34/Blood_surface_Icon.webp/38px-Blood_surface_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/3/34/Blood_surface_Icon.webp/50px-Blood_surface_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Blood\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/34/Blood_surface_Icon.webp/25px-Blood_surface_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/3/34/Blood_surface_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Blood_(surface)\" title=\"Blood (surface)\">Blood</a> surface under the user even if they have <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Unstable_Blood\" title=\"Unstable Blood\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d6/Generic_Blood_Icon.webp/20px-Generic_Blood_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/d/d6/Generic_Blood_Icon.webp/30px-Generic_Blood_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/d/d6/Generic_Blood_Icon.webp/40px-Generic_Blood_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Unstable Blood\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d6/Generic_Blood_Icon.webp/20px-Generic_Blood_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/d/d6/Generic_Blood_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Unstable_Blood\" title=\"Unstable Blood\">Unstable Blood</a>. An <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Unstable_Blood_(surface)\" title=\"Unstable Blood (surface)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/4/44/Generic_Explosion_Unfaded_Icon.webp/25px-Generic_Explosion_Unfaded_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/4/44/Generic_Explosion_Unfaded_Icon.webp/38px-Generic_Explosion_Unfaded_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/4/44/Generic_Explosion_Unfaded_Icon.webp/50px-Generic_Explosion_Unfaded_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Unstable Blood\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/4/44/Generic_Explosion_Unfaded_Icon.webp/25px-Generic_Explosion_Unfaded_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/4/44/Generic_Explosion_Unfaded_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Unstable_Blood_(surface)\" title=\"Unstable Blood (surface)\">Unstable Blood</a> surface would be expected.</li></ul>\n\n<p><i>Regarding The Pain Maiden's Blessing:</i></p>\n<ul><li>The description of The Pain Maiden's Blessing erroneously claims that the effect lasts until the <i>end</i> of the next turn, but it is instead removed at the <i>start</i> of it.</li></ul>\n</div>    \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714200652\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [vary‐revision‐sha1, no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.144 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.153 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 6652/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 83122/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 20246/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 28/200\nExpensive parser function count: 2/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 4/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0/1000\nLua time usage: 0.039/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 1816259/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%  126.082      1 -total\n 99.31%  125.207      1 Template:WeaponPage\n 27.48%   34.652     23 Template:Icon_text\n 27.07%   34.128     67 Template:Trim\n 20.66%   26.047     16 Template:Icon_link\n  9.18%   11.578      3 Template:Uid\n  9.06%   11.428     26 Template:Ifempty\n  8.31%   10.475      1 Template:SpellAction\n  7.97%   10.051     26 Template:Icon\n  6.75%    8.507      2 Template:Spell_action/format\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key bg3wiki:pcache:idhash:4218-0!canonical and timestamp 20260714200652 and revision id 371365. Rendering was triggered because: unknown\n -->\n</div>"}